1717,"children":-1},"Product MCP — AI control plane over the admin API (list\u002Fget tasks & runs, trigger\u002Fpause\u002Fresume, delete)",{"title":133,"path":134,"stem":135,"description":1719,"children":-1},"Docker stack, security, deployment",1788099637039]